Title: "Person"
Id: "ff0ed419-5f38-430d-84af-73cf67f47063"

Text: "```mlg-fragment
[AuthorHeader]
Person: <OpenText>+
biography?: <OpenText>
```

The person's display name is written directly in the `Person:` section.
`biography:` is optional and renders as Markdown card text in `mlg view`."
Id: "cad7d466-4575-45a2-b1f5-d78d3aae6b14"
